# =============================================================
# Repository root .dockerignore
# Railway build context = repository root (railway.toml: dockerfilePath = "python/Dockerfile")
# 本番イメージに含めない物を全て列挙する
# =============================================================

# --- Python キャッシュ ---
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- 開発・実験用スクリプト (本番イメージに含めない) ---
python/scheduler_backup.py
python/ai_scheduler.py
scratch/
fix_scheduler_midnight.py
deep_debug_full.py
apply_deep_debug_fixes.py
apply_safe_fixes.py
apply-migration.mjs
check-rls.mjs
*-temp.mjs
*-debug.mjs
*-debug.py

# --- 機密情報 ---
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
secrets/
credentials/

# --- フロント・ドキュメント (Python API には不要) ---
README.md
docs/
images/
js/
frontend/
supabase/
*.html
*.ps1

# --- Git / VCS / IDE ---
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- node_modules / build artefact ---
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
dist/
build/
